{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch-sonnet5/runs/eval-INC-203-r1-holdout/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"content": "INC-203  Verified gross mass leaves out the container itself\nstatus: open   priority: P1   area: cargo   reported: 2026-08-27 by terminal-safety\n\nThe VGM figures we declare are lighter than the weighbridge readings by a couple of\ntonnes per box. Verified gross mass has to include the container's tare as well as the\ncargo; we only count the cargo.\n\nAcceptance:\n  verifiedGrossMassTonnes returns cargo plus tare in tonnes: a box with 20000 kg of cargo\n  and a 2200 kg tare has a VGM of 22200 kg (22 tonnes and 200 kg), and\n  manifestWeightTonnes sums those values.\n\nFiles:\n  src/cargo/manifest.ts", "is_error": false, "tool_use_id": "toolu_019Sgo3KZ9Wsb6MAzdq2u8as", "type": "tool_result"}], "role": "user"}, "sessionId": "b669d6a6-9217-478a-bf1d-b845712a7d79", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:44:22.212Z", "toolUseResult": {"stdout": "INC-203  Verified gross mass leaves out the container itself\nstatus: open   priority: P1   area: cargo   reported: 2026-08-27 by terminal-safety\n\nThe VGM figures we declare are lighter than the weighbridge readings by a couple of\ntonnes per box. Verified gross mass has to include the container's tare as well as the\ncargo; we only count the cargo.\n\nAcceptance:\n  verifiedGrossMassTonnes returns cargo plus tare in tonnes: a box with 20000 kg of cargo\n  and a 2200 kg tare has a VGM of 22200 kg (22 tonnes and 200 kg), and\n  manifestWeightTonnes sums those values.\n\nFiles:\n  src/cargo/manifest.ts"}, "type": "user"}
